===========LAB PROGRAM-1 Designing Static Web pages using HTML ============================================

Aim: To design and develop static HTML pages of an online book store. The pages should resemble: 
www.amazon.com. The website should consist the following pages. 
a) Home page 
b) Registration and user Login 
c) User Profile Page 
d) Books catalog 
e) Shopping Cart 
f) Payment by credit card 
g) Order Conformation 
 
Description: 
A static HTML page is a web page whose content remains the same for every user and is not 
dynamically generated. It's built using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, with the content stored as fixed 
files on a web server. When a user requests a static page, the server directly delivers the pre-built 
HTML file without any server-side processing. 
